      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a good start, but I need the actual text for the monologues. Can you actually write them out for me? Like, don't just tell me the vibes, I need to see the dialogue. Go heavy on the slang and the way they actually talk so the satire really hits. Make the contrast between them super obvious.",
